---
/**
 * Short sidebar callout — used for notes, caveats, or supplementary context
 * that shouldn't interrupt the main prose flow but belongs near it.
 * Brand-yellow left border signals the aside treatment.
 *
 * Usage in MDX:
 *   <Aside>
 *     Note: this pattern only applies to authenticated users. Guest flows
 *     follow a different path described in the appendix.
 *   </Aside>
 */
---

<aside class="not-prose my-8 border-l-[3px] border-accent pl-5 lg:pl-6">
  <div class="text-xl lg:text-2xl font-normal text-body leading-body [&>p]:mb-3 [&>p:last-child]:mb-0">
    <slot />
  </div>
</aside>
